  <title class="- topic/title " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Profile%20foster%20orgs.dita" xtrc="title:1;3:10">Meet Cerberus: A Puppy with Big Drive!</title>
  <shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Profile%20foster%20orgs.dita" xtrc="shortdesc:1;4:14">
    Hi, I'm Cerberus! I'm an energetic and intelligent working dog breed looking for my forever home. Please read through this PDF guide to see if we're a good match!
  </shortdesc>
  <conbody class="- topic/body  concept/conbody " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Profile%20foster%20orgs.dita" xtrc="conbody:1;7:12">
    <image href="Images/IMG_0282.JPG" alt="Cerberus Sunbathing" width="381" height="320" align="left" placement="inline" class="- topic/image " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Profile%20foster%20orgs.dita" xtrc="image:1;9:21"/>
    <section class="- topic/section " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Profile%20foster%20orgs.dita" xtrc="section:1;10:14">
      <title class="- topic/title " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Profile%20foster%20orgs.dita" xtrc="title:2;11:14">Overview</title>
      <p class="- topic/p " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Profile%20foster%20orgs.dita" xtrc="p:1;12:10">Cerberus is a 10-month-old German Shepherd–Boxer mix with strong instincts and a clear need
        for structure. He thrives in a calm, predictable environment and builds deep bonds with the
        people who guide him. If you enjoy working with intelligent, responsive, and energetic dogs,
        then Cerberus may be an ideal fit. </p>
    </section>
    <section class="- topic/section " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Profile%20foster%20orgs.dita" xtrc="section:2;17:14">
      <title class="- topic/title " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Profile%20foster%20orgs.dita" xtrc="title:3;18:14">His Journey So Far</title>
      <p class="- topic/p " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Profile%20foster%20orgs.dita" xtrc="p:2;19:10">Cerberus started life in a rural setting with lots of open space but little structure. His
        early training relied more on discipline than reward, and he was later housed in a small
        hotel room with minimal outlets for energy or stimulation. Despite this, he stayed eager to
        connect and responded quickly to kindness and routine. When his living situation changed,
        Cerberus was brought to North Carolina, where he adjusted well in boarding care and showed
        how resilient and responsive he truly is. </p>
    </section>
    <section class="- topic/section " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Profile%20foster%20orgs.dita" xtrc="section:3;26:14">
      <title class="- topic/title " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Profile%20foster%20orgs.dita" xtrc="title:4;27:14">What He Needs</title>
      <p class="- topic/p " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Profile%20foster%20orgs.dita" xtrc="p:3;28:10">Cerberus will thrive in a home that offers:</p>
      <ul class="- topic/ul " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Profile%20foster%20orgs.dita" xtrc="ul:1;29:11">
        <li class="- topic/li " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Profile%20foster%20orgs.dita" xtrc="li:1;30:13">Daily structure and regular exercise</li>
        <li class="- topic/li " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Profile%20foster%20orgs.dita" xtrc="li:2;31:13">Positive reinforcement and clear expectations</li>
        <li class="- topic/li " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Profile%20foster%20orgs.dita" xtrc="li:3;32:13">Mental stimulation through play, training, or enrichment</li>
        <li class="- topic/li " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Profile%20foster%20orgs.dita" xtrc="li:4;33:13">Adults or children over five who respect boundaries</li>
        <li class="- topic/li " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Profile%20foster%20orgs.dita" xtrc="li:5;34:13">Limited time alone; he does best with a consistent daily care plan</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="- topic/p " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Profile%20foster%20orgs.dita" xtrc="p:4;36:10">He prefers stable households with minimal chaos. As a working breed, Cerberus will thrive
        in a space with a backyard or even on a farm! </p>
    </section>
    <section class="- topic/section " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Profile%20foster%20orgs.dita" xtrc="section:4;39:14">
      <note class="- topic/note " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Profile%20foster%20orgs.dita" xtrc="note:1;40:13">He is not suited for homes with cats, chaotic energy, or owners seeking a low-energy pet.</note>
    </section>
    <section class="- topic/section " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Profile%20foster%20orgs.dita" xtrc="section:5;42:14"><title class="- topic/title " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Profile%20foster%20orgs.dita" xtrc="title:5;42:21">Tools</title><p class="- topic/p " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Profile%20foster%20orgs.dita" xtrc="p:5;42:37">We’ve created several tools to help you through
        the adoption process. Here are some tools:</p><ul class="- topic/ul " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Profile%20foster%20orgs.dita" xtrc="ul:2;43:59">
        <li class="- topic/li " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Profile%20foster%20orgs.dita" xtrc="li:6;44:13"><xref href="Concept-Cerberus-Match-Guide-foster-orgs.dita" class="- topic/xref " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Profile%20foster%20orgs.dita" xtrc="xref:1;44:72" type="concept"><?ditaot usertext?>Dog Match Guide<?ditaot genshortdesc?><desc class="- topic/desc ">This guide outlines Cerberus’s care needs, temperament, and compatibility to help determine if you and Cerberus are a good match.       A strong match ensures long-term success for both dog and caregiver.   </desc></xref> – Compatibility,
          energy needs, and environment fit</li>
        <li class="- topic/li " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Profile%20foster%20orgs.dita" xtrc="li:7;46:13"><xref href="Reference-Common-Housing-Questions%20foster%20orgs.dita" class="- topic/xref " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Profile%20foster%20orgs.dita" xtrc="xref:2;46:82" type="reference"><?ditaot usertext?>Common Housing Questions<?ditaot genshortdesc?><desc class="- topic/desc ">     This reference answers the most common questions about preparing your home for Cerberus.    </desc></xref> - FAQs for adopting Cerberus.</li>
        <li class="- topic/li " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Profile%20foster%20orgs.dita" xtrc="li:8;47:13"><xref href="photo-repository-foster-orgs.dita" class="- topic/xref " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Profile%20foster%20orgs.dita" xtrc="xref:3;47:60" type="concept"><?ditaot usertext?>Photo Repository<?ditaot genshortdesc?><desc class="- topic/desc ">This photo repository contains pictures of Cerberus with his foster family and friends. Photos are accompanied with a short description.</desc></xref> - Collection of Cerberus's
          pictures with short descriptions</li>
        <li class="- topic/li " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Profile%20foster%20orgs.dita" xtrc="li:9;49:13"><xref href="Reference-Common-Housing-Questions%20foster%20orgs.dita" class="- topic/xref " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Profile%20foster%20orgs.dita" xtrc="xref:4;49:82" type="reference"><?ditaot usertext?>Cerberus's Daily Routine<?ditaot genshortdesc?><desc class="- topic/desc ">     This reference answers the most common questions about preparing your home for Cerberus.    </desc></xref> - Overview of
          Cerberus's daily routine</li>
        <li class="- topic/li " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Profile%20foster%20orgs.dita" xtrc="li:10;51:13"><xref href="Reference-Cerberus-Health-and-Vaccination-Record-foster-orgs.dita" class="- topic/xref " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Profile%20foster%20orgs.dita" xtrc="xref:5;51:92" type="reference"><?ditaot usertext?>Health and Vaccination Record<?ditaot genshortdesc?><desc class="- topic/desc ">This record shows Cerberus’s medical history, vaccination dates, and treatments for easy sharing with fosters, adopters, and vets.</desc></xref> – Details about Cerberus's recent and upcoming vaccines and doctor appointments</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <section class="- topic/section " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Profile%20foster%20orgs.dita" xtrc="section:6;54:14"><title class="- topic/title " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Profile%20foster%20orgs.dita" xtrc="title:6;54:21">Ready to Adopt?</title><p class="- topic/p " xtrf="file:/Users/mariahaque/Documents/Cerberus-Dog-Adoption-DITA/Foster%20Orgs./Concept-Cerberus-Profile%20foster%20orgs.dita" xtrc="p:6;54:47">If Cerberus sounds like a good fit for your home or
